## API Endpoints

### Scans
- `POST /api/scans` - Submit a new scan
- `GET /api/scans` - List scans (with filters)
- `GET /api/scans/{scanId}` - Get scan details

### Moons
- `GET /api/moons` - List all moons (with filters)
- `GET /api/moons/{moonId}` - Get moon composition & value
- `PATCH /api/moons/{moonId}` - Update moon metadata (name, owner, structure)
- `DELETE /api/moons/{moonId}` - Archive moon

### Systems
- `GET /api/systems/{systemId}/moons` - List moons in a system
- `GET /api/systems/{systemId}/value` - Total ISK value of all moons

### Materials
- `GET /api/materials` - List all materials found in scans
- `GET /api/materials/{typeId}/moons` - Find all moons with a specific material

### Pricing
- `POST /api/prices/update` - Trigger ESI price update
- `GET /api/prices/{typeId}` - Get current price for a material

### Export
- `GET /api/exports/moons/csv` - Export moons as CSV
- `GET /api/exports/moons/json` - Export moons as JSON

