## Authentication

The application uses **Eve Single Sign-On (SSO)** via OAuth2. Configure your Eve app at https://developers.eveonline.com.

1. Create an Eve app with scopes: `esi-universe.read_structures.v1`, `esi-markets.read_market_prices.v1`
2. Set `ESI_CLIENT_ID`, `ESI_SECRET_KEY`, and `ESI_CALLBACK_URL` in `.env`
3. Users authenticate by visiting `/auth/login`, which redirects to Eve SSO

## Permissions & Roles

- **Admin**: Full system access, user management, price updates
- **Moon Manager**: Can create/edit/delete moons, export data
- **Analyst**: Read-only access to moons and scans
- **Guest**: Public read access (if enabled)

